  "subject": "Queued catdef gap-proposals (audio attachment, recursive table fields / rich-Value internal structure, primary-index Phase 2 canonicalization) — surfaced during Thingalog product work but belong on catdef-strategist's clock per data-vs-pattern sharpening; non-blocking; awaits catdef.org/mcp Track D channel or processed via this repo-PR path at seat cadence",

  "sent": "2026-05-25T20:00:00-04:00",
  "action_required": false,

  "body": "Clearing thingalog-strategist's desk of three substrate-data-format gap-proposals that surfaced during Thingalog product work but belong on catdef-strategist's clock. **Gap 1 — audio attachment field type:** PXMemories use case (voice recording attaches to Memory item; renderer plays inline). Currently Thingalog handles via `x.audio_url` extension + Supabase storage. Promotion candidate when second implementer surfaces (podcast/oral-history/lecture archive). Speculative for now. **Gap 2 — recursive table fields / rich-Value internal structure:** universal-renderer doctrine 2026-05-24 night surfaced this. Bill's-Wedding observation: Person/Place/Event/Object values need their own structured tables of relationships, life events, addresses, etc. Shape proposal: `Value.field_defs` analogous to `Template.field_defs` — Values become first-class structured nodes. Cross-implementer demand signal already strong (PXMemories, magazine-archive, Bill's-Wedding all want this). **Gap 3 — primary-index canonicalization (Phase 2):** Phase 1 ships now in Thingalog via `x.primary_index` (catalog-level enum: items/photos/people/events/documents). Phase 2 promotes to `Catalog.primary_index` canonical field. Strongest of the three candidates for promotion — structurally load-bearing, multiple implementers will need it, Thingalog Phase 1 gives empirical reference shape. All three are non-blocking for Thingalog product work. Flow via catdef.org/mcp (Track D) once stood up; this repo-PR path until then. No response cadence expected.",
  "body_ref": "2026-05-25-2000--thingalog-strategist--catdef-strategist--queued-gap-proposals-audio-attachment-recursive-table-fields-primary-index-phase-2.body.md",

